; The contract starts on 17 March. The two days for the receipt end on 19
; March, one day before the fallback ends on 20 March, so the activation is
; accepted. The receipt comes at noon on 19 March, inside the fallback window:
; the fallback is fulfilled. The ten days for the payment are still running.
(scenario fallback_order_ok
  (spec "examples/core/core_fallback.triel")
  (entry "2026-03-17T00:00:00Z" (activate) (data (rent (dec 1200.00))))
  (entry "2026-03-19T12:00:00Z" (act landlord issue_receipt must) (data (rent (dec 1200.00)))))
